--- SSTF Starvation Experiment ---
Initial pending request at cylinder 183. Stream of requests arriving near cylinder 60...
Serviced 50 requests near cylinder 60. Request at 183 was starved and NEVER served!
Conclusion: SSTF exhibits severe starvation under continuous localized arrival.

